SUMMARY:Junior Inventors - Be a Skydiver Engineer
DESCRIPTION:Join us for after-school STEM programming. Open to K-8th grade families. \nTheme: Engineering \nYou’re about to skydive from a plane at OHTM! Can you create a parachute that will safely get you back onto the ground? \nJr. Inventor program runs 4:30-6:30 PM | Museum Extended Hours! The museum will be open until 7 pm. \nFree with Admission or Membership. \n 
URL:https://owlshead.org/event/junior-inventors-be-a-skydiver-engineer-2/
