SUMMARY:Parade of Lights- Offsite Event
DESCRIPTION:Rockland Festival of Lights Parade | November 28\nOHTM is joining the annual Festival of Lights Parade in downtown Rockland! Find a spot along the parade route and wave as the OHTM team rolls through in our beautifully decorated Model T bus. \nNovember 28 | 6 PM | Downtown Rockland | FREE EVENT
