DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at OHTM! For one magical day\, the museum transforms into a winter wonderland filled with festive activities. From meeting Santa to dancing with the Grinch\, Holidays at the Museum offers free\, family-friendly fun and plenty of holiday cheer for all. \n 
