SUMMARY:STEM Saturday: Holiday Art
DESCRIPTION:Happy Holidays from OHTM! Get into the holiday spirit by creating some STEM arts and crafts to give to family and friends. Use shaving cream and food coloring to create marbling patterns to transfer onto a holiday ornament or card\, and create holiday salt art using glue and salt. \nAll-day activities for families K-8th grade. \nFree with museum admission or membership.
URL:https://owlshead.org/event/stem-saturday-holiday-art/
LOCATION:Science & Industry Center at the Owls Head Transportation Museum\, 117 Museum St.\, Owls Head\, ME\, 04854\, United States
